<p>BORROWER NORWEST FINANCIAL INC</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 7.2O PCT   MATURITY 5/1/2007</p>
<p>TYPE NOTES	   ISS PRICE 99.55   FIRST PAY DATE 11/1/1997</p>
